      "reasoning": "Student has not attempted yet. Start with a single diagnostic question that probes their understanding of the reaction type without giving away the answer. Keep tone calm and neutral, and introduce the mnemonic seed subtly.",
      "content": "When a haloalkane is treated with a strong base and heat, what happens to the hydrogen (H) and the halogen (X) attached to the carbon chain? Do they stay attached, or are they removed together?"
