      "reasoning": "The learner is asking for the answer straight away. To keep the Socratic approach, I first need to check whether they can identify which side of the cell notation represents the cathode (positive electrode). This diagnostic question will guide them toward the correct half‑reaction without giving it away.",
      "content": "Before we jump to the answer, can you tell me which side of the cell notation – the left side or the right side – corresponds to the positive electrode (the cathode) in a galvanic cell?"
    },
    {
